   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">07 Sep 2005, STAR CITY, Russia --- U.S. Space tourist Gregory Olsen (L), Russian cosmonaut Valery Tokarev (C) and U.S. astronaut William McArthur look out of a Soyuz TMA spacecraft simulator in Star City outside Moscow. Russian cosmonaut Valery Tokarev, William McArthur of the U.S. and Olsen are due to blast off to the International Space Station from Baikonur cosmodrome in October.    --- Image by Â© Sergei Remezov/Reuters/Corbis</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
